ssues.ts`, `team-members.ts`\n- **Cycles:** `cycles.ts`, `cycle-issues.ts`\n- **Labels:** `labels.ts`\n- **Members:** `members.ts`\n- **Notifications:** `notifications.ts`, `notifications-count.ts`\n- **Comments:** `add-comment.ts`\n- **Bulk actions:** `bulk-update-issues.ts`\n- **Workspace:** `workspace.ts`\n- **Database:** `db.ts`\n\n### 7. Key Components for Projects Page\n\n#### Projects Page Components:\n\n**`/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/Projects.tsx`**\n- Fetches all projects, members, teams\n- Manages filter state (statuses, leads, teams)\n- Renders header with \"Create Project\" button\n- Passes filters to ProjectFilters component\n- Shows empty states and project grid\n\n**`/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/ProjectCard.tsx`**\n- Displays individual project card with:\n  - Project name (clickable link to `/project/{id}`)\n  - Status badge (Planned/In Progress/Completed/Cancelled) with class-based styling\n  - Lead avatar and name (or \"No lead\" placeholder)\n  - Target date with calendar icon (or \"No target date\")\n  - Progress bar (completed/total issues with percentage)\n  - Team icons/identifiers for participating teams\n- All fields have data-testid attributes\n\n**`/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/ProjectFilters.tsx`**\n- Three filter dropdowns:\n  1. **Status Filter:** Planned, In Progress, Completed, Cancelled (multi-select)\n  2. **Lead Filter:** Searchable member list with avatars and names (multi-select)\n  3. **Team Filter:** All workspace teams (multi-select)\n- Displays active filter badges showing count\n- Click-outside handler to close dropdowns\n- Toggle mechanism for each filter type\n\n**`/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/CreateProjectModal.tsx`**\n- Modal dialog with fields:\n  1. **Name** (text input, required, shows \"Name is required\" error)\n  2. **Description** (textarea, optional)\n  3. **Status** (dropdown, default \"Planned\")\n  4. **Lead** (searchable dropdown with member list and \"No lead\" option)\n  5. **Target date** (HTML date picker)\n  6. **Teams** (multi-select with chips/badges for selected teams)\n- Cancel and Create Project buttons\n- Overlay click to close\n- Escape key to close\n- Form reset on open\n- Validation for required name field\n\n**`/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/ProjectHeader.tsx`**\n- Displays project details with inline editing:\n  - Project name (inline text edit with Enter/Escape handling)\n  - Status badge (dropdown to change status)\n  - Progress bar (completed/total with percentage)\n  - Target date (date picker)\n  - Lead (searchable dropdown)\n- Two tabs: Issues and Overview\n- Handles state updates via Redux `updateProjectField`\n\n**`/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/ProjectIssuesTab.tsx`**\n- Lists all project issues grouped by team\n- Issue rows with:\n  - Priority icon\n  - Identifier and title (clickable)\n  - Status icon (clickable to change)\n  - Label badges\n  - Assignee avatar\n  - Due date\n- Bulk selection checkboxes\n- Bulk actions toolbar (Status, Priority, Assignee, Label)\n- Team group headers with issue counts\n- Collapsible team groups\n\n**`/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/ProjectOverviewTab.tsx`**\n- Three main sections:\n  1. **Description** - Inline editable markdown/text\n  2. **Milestones** - Add/edit/delete/toggle completion\n  3. **Key Metrics** - Total, completed, in-progress, remaining issues with percentages\n\n#### Related Shared Components:\n\n**Modals:**\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/CreateIssueModal.tsx` - For creating issues\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/CreateTeamModal.tsx` - For team creation\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/InviteMemberModal.tsx` - For member invitations\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/CreateLabel.tsx` - For label management\n\n**Filters & Dropdowns:**\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/FiltersToolbar.tsx` - Generic filters for My Issues\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/TeamFilters.tsx` - Filters for team issues page\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/GroupBySort.tsx` - Grouping and sorting options\n\n**Issue Components:**\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/IssueRow.tsx` - Individual issue display\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/IssueSidebar.tsx` - Issue detail sidebar\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/IssueHeader.tsx` - Issue header\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/BulkActions.tsx` - Bulk operations\n\n### 8. Redux State Management\n\n**Projects Slice:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/projectsSlice.ts`\n```typescript\n- Project interface with: id, name, description, status, targetDate, \n  leadId/leadName/leadEmail, totalIssues, completedIssues, teams[]\n- ProjectMember: id, name, email\n- ProjectTeamFilter: id, name, identifier\n- Actions: fetchProjects, createProject\n```\n\n**Project Detail Slice:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/projectDetailSlice.ts`\n```typescript\n- ProjectDetail with: all Project fields + inProgressIssues\n- ProjectMilestone: id, name, targetDate, completed\n- Actions: fetchProjectDetail, updateProjectField, \n  createMilestone, updateMilestone, deleteMilestone, etc.\n```\n\n### 9. Key Test Specifications for Projects\n\nFrom `/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md` (lines 1617-2105):\n\n**ProjectCard tests (18 specs):**\n- Display project name as clickable link\n- Status badge with correct styling per status\n- Lead with avatar and name\n- Target date formatting\n- Progress bar calculation (0%, 50%, 100%, with issues count)\n- Team icons for participating teams\n- Graceful handling of missing optional fields (no lead, no date, no issues)\n\n**ProjectFilters tests (16 specs):**\n- Status filter (multi-select: Planned, In Progress, Completed, Cancelled)\n- Lead filter (shows all workspace members searchable)\n- Team filter (shows all teams)\n- Filter combinations with AND logic\n- Active filter indicators\n- Clear filters restores all projects\n- Repeated filter usage\n\n**CreateProjectModal tests (18 specs):**\n- Modal opens with name field focused\n- Fields: Name, Description, Status, Lead, Target date, Teams\n- Validation: Name is required\n- Status dropdown defaults to \"Planned\"\n- Lead selector is searchable\n- Date picker functionality\n- Teams multi-select with chips\n- Successful creation with all/minimal fields\n- Cancel button and Escape key close without creating\n- Form reset after creation\n- Backdrop click closes modal\n\n**ProjectHeader tests (28 specs):**\n- Display all fields\n- Inline edit project name (Enter to save, Escape to cancel)\n- Inline status change via dropdown\n- Multiple status changes in sequence\n- Target date inline edit with date picker\n- Clear target date\n- Lead inline edit with search\n- Progress bar accuracy (with Done/Cancelled issues)\n- Tabs for Issues and Overview\n\n**ProjectIssuesTab tests (20+ specs):**\n- Issues grouped by team with count\n- Issue rows with all required fields\n- Status change from row\n- Team group collapse/expand\n- Bulk selection and actions (Status, Priority, Assignee, Label)\n- Empty state when no issues\n- Progress bar updates on status changes\n\n**ProjectOverviewTab tests (30+ specs):**\n- Description inline editing with markdown support\n- Milestones CRUD (add, edit, delete, toggle completion)\n- Key metrics display and updates\n- Empty states for description and milestones\n\n### 10. File Locations Summary\n\n**Core Pages and Components:**\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/Projects.tsx` - Projects listing page\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/ProjectDetail.tsx` - Project detail page\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/ProjectCard.tsx` - Project card display\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/ProjectFilters.tsx` - Filter controls\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/CreateProjectModal.tsx` - Create project modal\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/ProjectHeader.tsx` - Project detail header\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/ProjectIssuesTab.tsx` - 